/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:24:WhestBench is a benchmark for *white-box activation estimation*: given the weights of a randomly initialized ReLU multi-layer perceptron (MLP) and a strict floating-point-operation (FLOP) budget, predict the average post-activation value of every neuron when the network is fed standard Gaussian inputs.
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:25:{%- set companion = companion_repo or ("aicrowd/arc-whestbench-2026-evals" if (not splits and split == "public") else "aicrowd/arc-whestbench-2026") %}
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:27:**This is the Public Dataset Release for WhestBench 2026** — pre-baked MLPs paired with their ground-truth activation statistics, free to download and use while you develop your estimator. The actual contest evaluation runs against the private `public` and `holdout` splits of [`{{ companion }}`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/{{ companion }}), released per round under the same schema.
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:29:**This is the private Holdout split for WhestBench 2026** — consumed by the evaluator at grading time. It is not intended for participant download; the public release at [`{{ companion }}`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/{{ companion }}) is what you'll develop against.
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:31:**This is the `{{ split }}` dataset for WhestBench 2026** — pre-baked MLPs paired with their ground-truth activation statistics.
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:36:**This is the WhestBench 2026 Evaluation Dataset** — per-round MLP ground-truth that powers the leaderboards. It contains disjoint splits with different visibility:
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:38:- **`public`** ({{ '{:,}'.format(splits["public"].n_mlps) }} MLPs) — submissions are scored against this split with scores visible to participants on the **public leaderboard** in real time.
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:39:- **`holdout`** ({{ '{:,}'.format(splits["holdout"].n_mlps) }} MLPs) — submissions are also scored against this split, but the scores power the **private/final leaderboard** and are revealed only at the conclusion of the round.
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:41:This dataset is intentionally not part of the Public Release at [`{{ companion }}`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/{{ companion }}); develop your estimator against the public release first.
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:43:**This is the WhestBench 2026 Public Dataset Release** — pre-baked MLPs paired with their ground-truth activation statistics. Two **independent** splits, baked with **disjoint seeds**:
/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:45:- **`mini`** ({{ '{:,}'.format(splits["mini"].n_mlps) }} MLPs) — the development split. Small enough to download in seconds. Iterate on your estimator here.
